{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> The reason is that they shall not leave over from it to eat it tomorrow, but rather trust in HaShem, that tomorrow it will fall. For he is not commanded to eat it all; rather, if some remains to him and he cannot eat it, he shall cast it outside his tent."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:05.707785291Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}